# Estado

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    accTitle: Puerta
    accDescr: Una puerta se abre y se cierra
    state "Puerta cerrada" as Closed
    [*] --> Closed
    Closed --> Open : empujar
    Open --> Closed : tirar
    Closed : Cerrada con llave por defecto
    note right of Open : queda abierta
```
